                        dim + " in the array component '" +
                        arrayVar.getEncodedName() +
                        "is not equal to the size of the coresponding map vector '" +
                        thisMapArray.getEncodedName() + ".");
            }
            dim++;
        }
        //----- end  ndp 12/3/99

    }

