            nextItem + OIntegerSerializer.INT_SIZE + OShortSerializer.SHORT_SIZE + OByteSerializer.BYTE_SIZE + i * RID_SIZE);

        results.add(new ORecordId(clusterId, clusterPosition));
      }

      nextItem = nextNextItem;
    }

    return results;
  }

